# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep Selected Project Documentation
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# IMPORTANT:
# docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# Keep:
# docs/architecture/
# docs/rtl/
# docs/synthesis/
# docs/physical_design/
#
# These contain project documentation and selected results.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep Selected Waveform Documentation
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# The waveform directory itself is kept.
# Generated waveform databases are ignored above.
#
# You can keep:
# waveforms/README.md
# waveforms/*.png
# waveforms/*.pdf


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep Selected Synthesis Documentation
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# The synthesis directory itself is kept.
#
# If you have manually prepared summaries such as:
# synthesis/README.md
# synthesis/summary.md
# they remain tracked.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Netlist
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated netlists can become large.
# If your netlist/ directory contains ONLY generated files,
# ignore it:
#
# netlist/
#
# BUT for your project, I recommend keeping the final
# synthesized netlist if you want to demonstrate synthesis.
#
# Therefore netlist/ is NOT ignored here.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated Results
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw OpenLane/OpenROAD results
results/

# Keep documentation/screenshots separately in docs/
# rather than committing entire generated result trees.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Large Generated Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------

*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# Large database files
*.sqlite
*.db


